<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="id"> <head>     <meta charset="UTF-8">     <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">     <title>Ocean Pals - Sahabat Samudra</title>     <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">     <style>         :root {             --bg-sky: #E0F7FA;             --bg-sea: #B2EBF2;             --accent-coral: #FFAB91;             --accent-sand: #FFE082;             --text-dark: #2C3E50;             --white: #FFFFFF;             --card-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);         }          * {             margin: 0;             padding: 0;             box-sizing: border-box;         }          body {             font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;             background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-sky) 0%, var(--bg-sea) 100%);             color: var(--text-dark);             min-height: 100vh;             overflow-x: hidden;             position: relative;         }          /* Wave Background Decoration */         .ocean-bg {             position: absolute;             bottom: 0;             width: 100%;             height: 150px;             background: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg viewBox="0 0 1200 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M321.39,56.44c58-10.79,114.16-30.13,172-41.86,82.39-16.72,168.19-17.73,250.45-.39C823.78,31,906.67,72,985.66,92.83c70.05,18.48,146.53,26.09,214.34,3V120H0V95.8C59.71,118.08,130.83,121.3,201,112.5,241.6,107.4,282.2,85.2,321.39,56.44Z" fill="%2380DEEA"></path></svg>') repeat-x;             background-size: 1200px 150px;             z-index: 1;         }          /* Navigation */         nav {             display: flex;             justify-content: space-between;             align-items: center;             padding: 1.5rem 5%;             background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);             backdrop-filter: blur(10px);             border-radius: 0 0 25px 25px;             box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);             position: relative;             z-index: 10;         }          .logo {             font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;             font-size: 1.8rem;             color: #00838F;             display: flex;             align-items: center;             gap: 10px;         }          .nav-links {             display: flex;             list-style: none;             gap: 20px;         }          .nav-links a {             text-decoration: none;             color: var(--text-dark);             font-weight: 700;             padding: 8px 16px;             border-radius: 20px;             transition: all 0.3s ease;         }          .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {             background-color: var(--accent-coral);             color: var(--white);         }          /* Hero Section */         .hero {             display: flex;             align-items: center;             justify-content: space-between;             padding: 4rem 8%;             position: relative;             z-index: 2;             min-height: 80vh;         }          .hero-text {             max-width: 50%;         }          .hero-text h1 {             font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;             font-size: 3.2rem;             color: #006064;             line-height: 1.2;             margin-bottom: 1.5rem;         }          .hero-text p {             font-size: 1.2rem;             color: #37474F;             margin-bottom: 2rem;             line-height: 1.6;         }          .cta-btn {             display: inline-block;             background-color: var(--accent-sand);             color: var(--text-dark);             font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;             font-size: 1.2rem;             padding: 14px 32px;             border-radius: 30px;             text-decoration: none;             box-shadow: 0 6px 0px #FBC02D;             transition: all 0.2s ease;         }          .cta-btn:hover {             transform: translateY(-3px);             box-shadow: 0 9px 0px #FBC02D;         }          .cta-btn:active {             transform: translateY(2px);             box-shadow: 0 4px 0px #FBC02D;         }          /* Mascot Container */         .hero-mascot {             position: relative;             display: flex;             justify-content: center;             align-items: center;         }          .mascot-card {             background: var(--white);             padding: 30px;             border-radius: 40px;             box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);             text-align: center;             border: 4px solid #E0F2F1;             animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;         }          .mascot-avatar {             width: 180px;             height: 180px;             background: #E0F7FA;             border-radius: 50%;             margin: 0 auto 20px;             display: flex;             align-items: center;             justify-content: center;             font-size: 5rem;         }          .mascot-card h3 {             font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;             color: #00838F;             font-size: 1.5rem;         }          .mascot-card p {             color: #78909C;             font-size: 0.95rem;         }          /* Float Animation */         @keyframes float {             0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }             50% { transform: translateY(-15px); }         }          /* Responsive */         @media (max-width: 768px) {             .hero {                 flex-direction: column;                 text-align: center;                 padding-top: 2rem;             }             .hero-text {                 max-width: 100%;                 margin-bottom: 3rem;             }             .nav-links {                 display: none;             }         }     </style> </head> <body>      <!-- Header / Navigasi -->     <nav>         <div class="logo">             <span>🐢</span> Ocean Pals         </div>         <ul class="nav-links">             <li><a href="#" class="active">Beranda</a></li>             <li><a href="#">Teman Laut</a></li>             <li><a href="#">Misi Kita</a></li>             <li><a href="#">Pojok Cerita</a></li>             <li><a href="#">Klub</a></li>         </ul>     </nav>      <!-- Main Content / Hero -->     <main class="hero">         <div class="hero-text">             <h1>Yuk, Berteman dengan Lautan! 🌊</h1>             <p>Jelajahi keajaiban samudra bersama teman-teman laut yang imut. Belajar menjaga ekosistem laut jadi lebih seru dan mudah!</p>             <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Mulai Petualangan 🚀</a>         </div>          <div class="hero-mascot">             <div class="mascot-card">                 <div class="mascot-avatar">🐢</div>                 <h3>Penyu Penyu</h3>                 <p>Pemandu Lautmu</p>             </div>         </div>     </main>      <!-- Wave Background Footer -->     <div class="ocean-bg"></div>  </body> </html
